{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>About This Demo</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo version of <i>The Roast: Coffee Shop Simulator</i> lets you experience the first few in-game days of running your own cozy coffee shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this demo, you can:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take and fulfill customer orders</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prepare basic coffee drinks (espresso, latte, americano, etc.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Handle multiple days with changing customer patterns and demands</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage limited inventory and basic shop workflow</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Please note:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo includes only a few early in-game days</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Advanced systems like full shop customization, upgrade mechanics, reputation system, and extended drink recipes are only available in the full game</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We hope you enjoy this taste of <i>The Roast</i> and look forward to your feedback.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc49 Don\u2019t forget to <strong>add the full game to your wishlist</strong> to stay updated and support the development!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Live Your Dream \u2013 Start Your Own Coffee Shop!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795930/extras/211a3f450909f87de85276a08b0901d3.poster.avif?t=1753972119\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795930/extras/211a3f450909f87de85276a08b0901d3.webm?t=1753972119\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795930/extras/211a3f450909f87de85276a08b0901d3.mp4?t=1753972119\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once stuck behind a desk in a soulless 9-to-5 job, those days are now behind you! You and your friends are finally chasing the dream of opening your very own coffee shop. Nestled in the heart of the city, this charming little space\u2014snatched up at a bargain\u2014holds the potential to become the hottest caf\u00e9 in town. Now it\u2019s time to roll up your sleeves and turn that dream into reality!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Take Orders \u2013 Keep the Customers Happy!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this game, you\u2019ll need to prepare customer orders quickly and accurately. Every cup of coffee reflects a player\u2019s unique style. This phase tests your timing, teamwork, and memory skills as you collect customer satisfaction points and grow your caf\u00e9!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Be Your Own Boss \u2013 Manage Your Finances!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795930/extras/5046118c8045d6d7078d8d651b83101a.poster.avif?t=1753972119\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795930/extras/5046118c8045d6d7078d8d651b83101a.webm?t=1753972119\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795930/extras/5046118c8045d6d7078d8d651b83101a.mp4?t=1753972119\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rent, supply costs, staff wages... Staying profitable at the end of each day is up to you. Make strategic choices to expand your shop!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Ready your cups \u2013 success is brewing!</strong></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3795930?t=1753972119","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/379593